{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fgs-entra-token-existing-user",
    "name": "FGS Entra Token (Existing User)",
    "description": "Obtain Entra tokens for an **already registered** user.\n\nRedirect URI: `https://localhost:8443/api/v1/auth/entra/callback` (same as FGS app registration — `redirectUri` in **FGS Globals**).\n\n## Recommended — Manual browser flow\n1. Select **FGS Globals (Local)** environment.\n2. Set `entraUserEmail`, `entraClientSecret`.\n3. Ensure gateway is running on `https://localhost:8443`.\n4. Run **Manual browser flow → 1. Copy sign-in URL to console** → **Send**.\n5. Open **View → Show Postman Console**, copy URL into Chrome/Edge, sign in.\n6. Browser redirects to the FGS callback. **Copy `code=` from the address bar** (ignore any error JSON on the page).\n7. Paste into environment variable `authCode`.\n8. Run **2. Exchange Authorization Code** → `accessToken` is set automatically.\n9. Use other FGS collections (FileService, SetupService, etc.).\n\n## Token lifetime\nAccess tokens ~60 min. `offline_access` returns a **refresh token** — run **3. Refresh Access Token** to renew.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "oauth2",
    "oauth2": [
      { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{entraAuthority}}/{{entraTenantId}}/oauth2/v2.0/authorize", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{entraAuthority}}/{{entraTenantId}}/oauth2/v2.0/token", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{entraClientId}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{entraClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "scope", "value": "openid profile email offline_access", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "{{redirectUri}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "useBrowser", "value": true, "type": "boolean" },
      {
        "key": "authRequestQueryParams",
        "value": [
          { "key": "p", "value": "{{entraUserFlow}}", "enabled": true },
          { "key": "login_hint", "value": "{{entraUserEmail}}", "enabled": true },
          { "key": "response_mode", "value": "query", "enabled": true }
        ],
        "type": "any"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const refreshToken = pm.environment.get('refreshToken');",
          "const expiresAt = Number(pm.environment.get('accessTokenExpiresAt') || 0);",
          "const accessToken = pm.environment.get('accessToken');",
          "const skipAutoRefresh = pm.variables.get('skipAutoRefresh') === 'true';",
          "if (skipAutoRefresh || !refreshToken || !accessToken || !expiresAt) { return; }",
          "const bufferMs = 5 * 60 * 1000;",
          "if (Date.now() < expiresAt - bufferMs) { return; }",
          "const tokenUrl = pm.environment.get('entraAuthority') + '/' + pm.environment.get('entraTenantId') + '/oauth2/v2.0/token';",
          "pm.sendRequest({",
          "  url: tokenUrl, method: 'POST',",
          "  header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },",
          "  body: { mode: 'urlencoded', urlencoded: [",
          "    { key: 'grant_type', value: 'refresh_token' },",
          "    { key: 'client_id', value: pm.environment.get('entraClientId') },",
          "    { key: 'client_secret', value: pm.environment.get('entraClientSecret') },",
          "    { key: 'refresh_token', value: refreshToken },",
          "    { key: 'scope', value: 'openid profile email offline_access' }",
          "  ]}",
          "}, (err, res) => {",
          "  if (err || !res || res.code !== 200) return;",
          "  const body = res.json();",
          "  if (body.access_token) pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
          "  if (body.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', body.refresh_token);",
          "  if (body.expires_in) pm.environment.set('accessTokenExpiresAt', String(Date.now() + body.expires_in * 1000));",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Sign in (read first)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "How to sign in",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "https://postman-echo.com/get",
            "description": "**Use Manual browser flow** (folder below).\n\nThe FGS redirect URI is `https://localhost:8443/api/v1/auth/entra/callback`. After Entra login the browser lands on that URL with `?code=...` in the address bar.\n\nThe FGS callback page may show an error JSON (it expects an invitation `state` for onboarding). That is OK — **copy the `code` from the URL** before the page loads or from the address bar, set `authCode`, then run **2. Exchange Authorization Code**.\n\nPostman **Get New Access Token** (collection Authorization tab) does **not** auto-return when using the FGS callback URL — use the manual flow instead."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const base = pm.environment.get('entraAuthority') + '/' + pm.environment.get('entraTenantId') + '/oauth2/v2.0/authorize';",
                  "const q = new URLSearchParams({",
                  "  client_id: pm.environment.get('entraClientId'),",
                  "  response_type: 'code',",
                  "  redirect_uri: pm.environment.get('redirectUri'),",
                  "  response_mode: 'query',",
                  "  scope: 'openid profile email offline_access',",
                  "  login_hint: pm.environment.get('entraUserEmail') || '',",
                  "  p: pm.environment.get('entraUserFlow'),",
                  "  state: 'postman-existing-user'",
                  "});",
                  "const url = base + '?' + q.toString();",
                  "console.log('=== Open this URL in Chrome/Edge ===');",
                  "console.log(url);",
                  "console.log('=== Redirect URI:', pm.environment.get('redirectUri'), '===');",
                  "console.log('=== After login, copy code= from the callback URL into authCode ===');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Manual browser flow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Copy sign-in URL to console",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "https://postman-echo.com/get",
            "description": "Click **Send**, then open **View → Show Postman Console**. Copy the printed URL into Chrome or Edge.\n\nAfter sign-in you will be redirected to `{{redirectUri}}?code=...` — copy the code into `authCode`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const base = pm.environment.get('entraAuthority') + '/' + pm.environment.get('entraTenantId') + '/oauth2/v2.0/authorize';",
                  "const q = new URLSearchParams({",
                  "  client_id: pm.environment.get('entraClientId'),",
                  "  response_type: 'code',",
                  "  redirect_uri: pm.environment.get('redirectUri'),",
                  "  response_mode: 'query',",
                  "  scope: 'openid profile email offline_access',",
                  "  login_hint: pm.environment.get('entraUserEmail') || '',",
                  "  p: pm.environment.get('entraUserFlow'),",
                  "  state: 'postman-existing-user'",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Open in browser:', base + '?' + q.toString());",
                  "console.log('Callback:', pm.environment.get('redirectUri'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Exchange Authorization Code",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.variables.set('skipAutoRefresh', 'true');"] }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Token exchange succeeded', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "  if (body.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', body.refresh_token);",
                  "  if (body.expires_in) pm.environment.set('accessTokenExpiresAt', String(Date.now() + body.expires_in * 1000));",
                  "  const parts = body.access_token.split('.');",
                  "  if (parts.length >= 2) {",
                  "    const payload = JSON.parse(atob(parts[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/')));",
                  "    if (payload.tenant_id) pm.environment.set('tenantId', String(payload.tenant_id));",
                  "    if (payload.company_id) pm.environment.set('companyId', String(payload.company_id));",
                  "    if (payload.exp) pm.environment.set('accessTokenExpiresAt', String(payload.exp * 1000));",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{entraClientId}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{entraClientSecret}}" },
                { "key": "code", "value": "{{authCode}}" },
                { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "{{redirectUri}}" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "openid profile email offline_access" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{entraAuthority}}/{{entraTenantId}}/oauth2/v2.0/token",
            "description": "Exchanges `authCode` with Entra directly. `redirect_uri` must match the authorize step (`{{redirectUri}}`)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Refresh Access Token",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.variables.set('skipAutoRefresh', 'true');"] }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Refresh succeeded', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
              "  if (body.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', body.refresh_token);",
              "  if (body.expires_in) pm.environment.set('accessTokenExpiresAt', String(Date.now() + body.expires_in * 1000));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "grant_type", "value": "refresh_token" },
            { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{entraClientId}}" },
            { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{entraClientSecret}}" },
            { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "{{refreshToken}}" },
            { "key": "scope", "value": "openid profile email offline_access" }
          ]
        },
        "url": "{{entraAuthority}}/{{entraTenantId}}/oauth2/v2.0/token"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Verify - FileService AuthCheck",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
        },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": "{{fileServiceUrl}}/api/v1/health/auth-check",
        "description": "Confirms `accessToken` is accepted by FileService JWT validation."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Auth check HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Token valid', function () { pm.expect(body.valid).to.eql(true); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
